| Method | Purpose | Status Code |
|--------|---------|-------------|
| GET | Retrieve resource | 200 |
| POST | Create resource | 201 |
| PUT | Full update | 200 |
| PATCH | Partial update | 200 |
| DELETE | Delete resource | 204 |

